{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">「白海豚」的殘餘環流亦影響江蘇省，宜興市山區在暴雨下山洪暴發。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上片段見到，山洪來勢洶洶，沖毀大片樹林，瞬間淹沒道路，汽車被水浸著。宜興市多地清晨起下暴雨，三個小時降雨量超過100毫米。其中一個鄉鎮暴發山洪，多個村莊暫停供水。當局多個部門出動緊急救援。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-2000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20267iFF8AjiWB1786712050.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-2000_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T13:18:51.220176+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}